#: codec/2/912/0x390090/0
msgid ""
"Snake, Peace Walker has crossed the\n"
"border\n"
msgstr "Snake，Peace Walker 已越过\n边境\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390090/1
msgid ""
"and entered a U.S. military supply base\n"
"on the southeastern shore of Lago\n"
"Cocibolca.\n"
msgstr "并进入了位于科西博尔卡湖\n东南岸的一处美军\n补给基地。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390090/2
msgid ""
"Coldman's targeting the MSF plant -\n"
"that's us.\n"
msgstr "科尔德曼的目标是MSF工厂——\n就是我们。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390090/3
msgid ""
"Don't let it launch that nuke! Destroy\n"
"Peace Walker!\n"
msgstr "别让它发射核弹！摧毁\n和平行者！\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390250/0
msgid ""
"Snake, Peace Walker's being controlled\n"
"from the control tower! It's to the\n"
"northeast.\n"
msgstr "Snake，Peace Walker 正被\n控制塔操控着！它就在\n东北方向。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390250/1
msgid ""
"Get going! We'll be there to back you up!\n"
msgstr "快去吧！我们会支援你！\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390370/0
msgid ""
"Snake, don't let it launch the nuke!\n"
msgstr "SNAKE，别让它发射核弹！\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390410/0
msgid ""
"Snake! You have to stop that data from\n"
"being sent!\n"
msgstr "SNAKE！必须阻止数据\n被发送出去！\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x3904c0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, we've got a problem. Zadornov's\n"
"not in his cell.\n"
msgstr "SNAKE，出事了。扎多尔诺夫\n不在牢房。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x3904c0/2
msgid ""
"He must have used his prosthetic as a\n"
"blowtorch to cut through the bars.\n"
msgstr "他肯定用假肢当喷灯\n烧断了铁栏。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x3904c0/3
msgid ""
"But we've managed to narrow down his\n"
"location using a transmitter we planted\n"
"on him.\n"
msgstr "不过我们在他身上装了发信器，\n已经缩小了他的\n位置范围。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x3904c0/4
msgid ""
"I'm adding a new mission. Find the KGB\n"
"agent Zadornov!\n"
msgstr "新任务。找到\n克格勃特工扎多尔诺夫！\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x3906d0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, Zadornov has escaped custody.\n"
msgstr "SNAKE，扎多尔诺夫逃走了。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x3906d0/1
#: codec/2/912/0x390b50/1
#: codec/2/912/0x390e90/1
msgid ""
"Find him!\n"
msgstr "找到他！\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x3907a0/0
msgid ""
"Heh heh... So you found me.\n"
msgstr "嘿嘿……你找到我了。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x3907a0/1
msgid ""
"It wasn't hard. What're you up to, anyway?\n"
msgstr "不难找。你到底想干什么？\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x3907a0/2
msgid ""
"Just... going for a stroll.\n"
msgstr "只是……散散步。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x3907a0/3
msgid ""
"Kaz, I've got Zadornov. Returning home.\n"
msgstr "卡兹，我抓到扎多尔诺夫了。回基地。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x3907a0/4
msgid ""
"Acknowledged, Snake.\n"
msgstr "收到，SNAKE。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390940/0
msgid ""
"Bad news, Snake. Zadornov's on the loose.\n"
msgstr "坏消息，SNAKE。扎多尔诺夫跑了。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390940/1
msgid ""
"What, again?!\n"
msgstr "什么，又跑了？！\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390940/2
msgid ""
"It's funny. We took away his prosthetic\n"
"and did a full body check.\n"
msgstr "说来好笑。拿走了他假肢，\n还做了全身检查。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390940/3
msgid ""
"We even increased the guard.\n"
msgstr "甚至加了守卫。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390940/4
msgid ""
"Think he had help?\n"
msgstr "有人帮他？\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390940/5
msgid ""
"Impossible. Anyway, I'm adding a new\n"
"mission. Locate and recover Zadornov!\n"
msgstr "不可能。总之，加了新任务。\n找到并带回扎多尔诺夫！\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390b50/0
#: codec/2/912/0x390e90/0
msgid ""
"Snake, Zadornov's disappeared from his\n"
"cell again.\n"
msgstr "SNAKE，扎多尔诺夫又\n从牢房消失了。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390c30/0
msgid ""
"Kaz, I caught Zadornov.\n"
msgstr "卡兹，扎多尔诺夫抓到了。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390c30/1
msgid ""
"I-impossible! I thought I'd made it...\n"
msgstr "不可能！我以为搞定了……\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390c30/2
msgid ""
"Acknowledged. And appreciated.\n"
msgstr "收到。辛苦了。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390d50/0
msgid ""
"Snake, Zadornov has disappeared from\n"
"his cell.\n"
msgstr "SNAKE，扎多尔诺夫\n从牢房消失了。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390d50/1
msgid ""
"What? You're kidding, right?\n"
msgstr "什么？你开玩笑吧？\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390d50/2
msgid ""
"Afraid not. You've got a new mission: find\n"
"Zadornov!\n"
msgstr "没开玩笑。新任务：找到\n扎多尔诺夫！\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390f70/0
msgid ""
"I got him, Kaz.\n"
msgstr "抓到了，卡兹。\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390f70/1
msgid ""
"...Slipped up again...\n"
msgstr "……又搞砸了……\n"

#: codec/2/912/0x390f70/2
msgid ""
"Acknowledged. Bring him on in.\n"
msgstr "收到。带他进来。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391070/0
msgid ""
"Umm... Snake?\n"
msgstr "呃……SNAKE？\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391070/1
msgid ""
"Don't tell me... Zadornov?\n"
msgstr "别告诉我……扎多尔诺夫？\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391070/2
msgid ""
"Bingo. The guard left his post and the\n"
"dude was gone when he got back.\n"
msgstr "答对了。守卫擅离职守，回来时\n人已经不见了。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391070/3
msgid ""
"Sounds like the guard needs a guard.\n"
msgstr "看来守卫也需要人看着。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391070/4
msgid ""
"He was off with the girls. Paz invited him\n"
"to try some of their cooking.\n"
msgstr "他去找姑娘们了。帕兹请他\n尝尝她们做的菜。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391070/5
msgid ""
"He says he loved every second of it.\n"
msgstr "他说他每一秒都很享受。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391070/6
msgid ""
"Is that jealousy, Kaz?\n"
msgstr "卡兹，你嫉妒？\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391070/7
msgid ""
"Anyway, there's a new mission waiting for\n"
"you. Find Zadornov, Snake!\n"
msgstr "总之，新任务在等你。\n找到扎多尔诺夫，SNAKE！\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391070/8
msgid ""
"Okay, okay...\n"
msgstr "好，好……\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/0
#: codec/2/913/0x391350/2
msgid ""
"Snake! Zadornov's done it again!\n"
msgstr "SNAKE！扎多尔诺夫又跑了！\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/1
msgid ""
"great...\n"
msgstr "太好了……\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/3
msgid ""
"Gimme a break...\n"
msgstr "饶了我吧……\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/4
msgid ""
"Snake! Listen, Zadornov's done it again!\n"
msgstr "SNAKE！扎多尔诺夫又跑了！\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/5
msgid ""
"C'mon!\n"
msgstr "拜托！\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/6
msgid ""
"I hate to entertain the thought, but this\n"
"might be an inside job.\n"
msgstr "我不想这么想，但这\n可能是内鬼干的。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/7
msgid ""
"What the hell's he after, anyway?\n"
msgstr "他到底想干嘛？\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/8
msgid ""
"No clue. Can't imagine he's just out to\n"
"annoy us, though.\n"
msgstr "毫无头绪。不过，我无法想象他只是来\n惹恼我们的。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/9
msgid ""
"You know, it might not be worth keeping\n"
"him here. If he's not going to join us...\n"
msgstr "你知道，也许不值得把他\n留在这里。如果他不加入我们……\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/10
msgid ""
"You may be right.\n"
msgstr "也许你对。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/11
msgid ""
"I thought it might boost our Russian\n"
"compatriots' morale, but...\n"
msgstr "我以为能提振俄罗斯\n同胞士气，但……\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/12
msgid ""
"OK. I'll think it over.\n"
msgstr "好。我再想想。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/13
msgid ""
"Let's hope he's just playing\n"
"hide-and-seek...\n"
msgstr "希望他只是在玩\n捉迷藏……\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391350/14
msgid ""
"I've added a new mission. Go get\n"
"Zadornov!\n"
msgstr "新增任务。去抓\n扎多诺夫！\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x3917c0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, Zadornov's disappeared again.\n"
msgstr "SNAKE，扎多尔诺夫又没了。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x3917c0/1
msgid ""
"Get out there and retrieve him!\n"
msgstr "出去把他找回来！\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x3918a0/0
msgid ""
"Found our friend, Kaz.\n"
msgstr "找到他，卡兹。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x3918a0/1
msgid ""
"...Damn it... And I was so close ...\n"
msgstr "……该死……就差一点……\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x3918a0/2
msgid ""
"Great. Good work, Snake.\n"
msgstr "干得好，SNAKE。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x3919b0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, Zadornov's escaped custody again.\n"
msgstr "SNAKE，扎多尔诺夫又逃走了。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x3919b0/1
msgid ""
"You have to track him down!\n"
msgstr "你得把他追回来！\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391a90/0
msgid ""
"I found him, Kaz.\n"
msgstr "找到他，卡兹。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391a90/1
msgid ""
"Close... but no cigar.\n"
msgstr "差一点，没成。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391a90/2
msgid ""
"Not for you, anyway. Snake, We're coming\n"
"to pick him up.\n"
msgstr "反正不是给你。斯内克，我们来\n接他。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391bb0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, you're not gonna believe this, but...\n"
msgstr "SNAKE，你肯定不信，但……\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391bb0/2
msgid ""
"Zadornov's missing again.\n"
msgstr "扎多尔诺夫又不见了。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391bb0/3
msgid ""
"Kaz, are you sure somebody's not... I don't\n"
"know, letting him out on purpose?\n"
msgstr "卡兹，你确定没有人……我不知道，\n故意放他出去？\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391bb0/4
msgid ""
"You think I have time to assemble a mole\n"
"hunt?\n"
msgstr "你觉得我有空抓\n内鬼吗？\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391bb0/5
msgid ""
"Man, this guy isn't just good, he's so good\n"
"it's scary.\n"
msgstr "天，这家伙不光厉害，简直\n吓人。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391bb0/6
msgid ""
"If he's doing this alone, that is.\n"
msgstr "前提是他一个人干的。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391bb0/7
msgid ""
"Anyway, he left a trail, so we've got a\n"
"good idea of where he's probably hiding.\n"
msgstr "总之他留下踪迹，我们大致\n知道他可能藏哪。\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391bb0/8
msgid ""
"You know what the mission is...\n"
msgstr "任务内容你知道……\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391bb0/9
msgid ""
"Find Zadornov, Snake!\n"
msgstr "找到扎多尔诺夫，SNAKE！\n"

#: codec/2/913/0x391ef0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, Zadornov's escaped. You have to\n"
"find him!\n"
msgstr "SNAKE，扎多尔诺夫逃了。快\n找到他！\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x3920c0/0
msgid ""
"It, ah, happened again, Snake.\n"
msgstr "又、又来了，SNAKE。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x3920c0/1
msgid ""
"Zadornov? What's he got, an escape\n"
"fetish?\n"
msgstr "扎多尔诺夫？逃上瘾了\n不成？\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x3920c0/2
msgid ""
"He clearly has friends on the inside,\n"
msgstr "他显然有内应，\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x3920c0/3
msgid ""
"but we've got no way of knowing who.\n"
msgstr "但我们查不出是谁。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x3920c0/4
msgid ""
"Ugh. Persistent bastard, I'll give him that.\n"
"Where is he this time?\n"
msgstr "唉。这家伙真够顽固的。\n这次他在哪？\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x3920c0/5
msgid ""
"That's the thing. He must've found and\n"
"gotten rid of the transmitter.\n"
msgstr "问题就在这。他肯定找到并\n拆掉了发信器。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x3920c0/6
msgid ""
"We've got no idea where he is. Snake,\n"
"think you can find him?\n"
msgstr "不知他在哪。SNAKE，\n你能找到他吗？\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x3920c0/7
msgid ""
"...We can't just let him run around -\n"
"makes us look bad.\n"
msgstr "……不能让他到处乱跑——\n太丢脸了。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x3920c0/8
msgid ""
"I'll say. Since we can't locate him, I'm\n"
"afraid I can't add a new mission.\n"
msgstr "是啊。既然找不到他，恐怕\n没法新增任务。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x3920c0/9
msgid ""
"You know what to do, Snake.\n"
msgstr "你知道咋做，SNAKE。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/0
msgid ""
"Snake, you there?\n"
msgstr "SNAKE，在吗？\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/1
msgid ""
"Yeah. What's up?\n"
msgstr "在。怎么了？\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/2
msgid ""
"You've gotta talk to Amanda.\n"
msgstr "你得找阿曼达谈谈。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/3
msgid ""
"What happened?\n"
msgstr "怎么了？\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/4
msgid ""
"She wants to leave sickbay and get back\n"
"on the battlefield, but she's not fully\n"
"healed.\n"
msgstr "她想离开医务室重返\n战场，但伤还没\n痊愈。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/5
msgid ""
"She's still in crutches - who'd be crazy\n"
"enough to try and fight like that?!\n"
msgstr "她还拄着拐杖——谁会疯到\n那样去打仗？！\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/6
msgid ""
"You have to talk some sense into her.\n"
msgstr "你得劝劝她。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/7
msgid ""
"Is she with you right now?\n"
msgstr "她跟你在一起？\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/8
msgid ""
"No, she's in sickbay.\n"
msgstr "不，她在医务室。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/9
msgid ""
"She keeps shouting about how she\n"
"doesn't want to be there.\n"
msgstr "她一直嚷嚷着不想\n待在那。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/10
msgid ""
"She won't shut up about it. She's driving\n"
"me-\n"
msgstr "她没完没了，快把我\n逼——\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/11
msgid ""
"Let her go.\n"
msgstr "让她去吧。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/13
msgid ""
"If that's what she wants, let her go.\n"
msgstr "既然她想去，就让她去吧。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/14
msgid ""
"I'm really not in the mood for jokes, Snake.\n"
msgstr "我真没心情开玩笑，SNAKE。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/15
msgid ""
"I'm serious. Let her go.\n"
msgstr "真的。让她去。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/16
msgid ""
"Why? So she can come back in a body\n"
"bag?\n"
msgstr "为什么？好让她躺在尸袋里\n回来吗？\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/17
msgid ""
"I'm really not in the mood for jokes, Kaz.\n"
msgstr "我真没心情开玩笑，卡兹。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/19
msgid ""
"Amanda isn't the type to just sit around\n"
"in sickbay.\n"
msgstr "阿曼达不会乖乖\n躺医务室。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/20
msgid ""
"She has a sense of duty - her purpose in\n"
"life is to fight.\n"
msgstr "她有责任感——她人生的\n意义就是战斗。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/21
msgid ""
"The battlefield isn't just the best thing\n"
"for her, it's the best thing for her\n"
"compas, too.\n"
msgstr "战场对她来说不仅是最适合的地方，\n对她的部下来说\n也是如此。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/22
msgid ""
"She'll be a huge morale boost - that can\n"
"only benefit MSF.\n"
msgstr "她能极大鼓舞士气，\n对MSF只有好处。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/24
msgid ""
"You're good at fighting, Kaz - one of the\n"
"best...\n"
msgstr "你很擅长战斗，卡兹——你是\n最优秀的之一……\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/25
msgid ""
"but you've got a lot to learn when it\n"
"comes to people.\n"
msgstr "但与人相处，\n你还有很多要学。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/26
msgid ""
"... So where should I put her?\n"
msgstr "……那把她编到哪？\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/27
msgid ""
"I'll think it over and find a team for her.\n"
msgstr "我考虑一下，给她找个队伍。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/28
msgid ""
"Don't worry, she won't let us down.\n"
msgstr "放心，她不会让我们失望的。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392460/29
msgid ""
"Whatever you say, Boss.\n"
msgstr "随你吧，BOSS。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392d00/0
msgid ""
"I got a report in from the R&D team.\n"
msgstr "研发组来了份报告。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392d00/1
msgid ""
"They've finished plans for a new hex-type\n"
"plant.\n"
msgstr "新型六边形工厂\n已设计完成。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392d00/2
msgid ""
"And today they're gonna start\n"
"construction on the first block.\n"
msgstr "今天他们就要开始\n第一区的建设了。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392d00/3
msgid ""
"Can't wait to finally say goodbye to this\n"
"scrap heap.\n"
msgstr "真希望能早日告别这个\n破铜烂铁堆。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392d00/4
msgid ""
"Only thing is, we don't have nearly\n"
"enough GMP.\n"
msgstr "只是我们的GMP\n远远不够。\n"

#: codec/2/914/0x392d00/5
msgid ""
"We'll need to recruit more soldiers to get\n"
"more GMP. You know what to do, Snake.\n"
msgstr "得招募更多士兵来获取\n更多GMP。你知道怎么做，斯内克。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/0
msgid ""
"Got a sec, Snake?\n"
msgstr "有空吗，SNAKE？\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/2
msgid ""
"It's about Paz. You know, she doesn't\n"
"have any family.\n"
msgstr "关于帕兹。你知道，她\n没有家人。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/3
msgid ""
"She got a scholarship thanks to\n"
"Zadornov, and was living at the dorms...\n"
msgstr "多亏扎多诺夫，她拿到\n奖学金，一直住宿舍……\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/4
msgid ""
"But he was KGB.\n"
msgstr "可他是克格勃。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/5
msgid ""
"All signs are her scholarship came from\n"
"the KGB, too.\n"
msgstr "迹象表明她奖学金也来自\n克格勃。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/6
msgid ""
"Even if they let him go, she's not going to\n"
"be seeing any more money.\n"
msgstr "就算他们放了她，她也拿不到\n更多钱了。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/7
msgid ""
"It wouldn't have been much anyway.\n"
msgstr "反正本来也没多少。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/8
msgid ""
"So I was wondering, what about letting\n"
"her stay here a while?\n"
msgstr "所以我在想，能不能让她\n在这待一阵子？\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/9
msgid ""
"What does she think?\n"
msgstr "她怎么想？\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/10
msgid ""
"She says she wants to help out.\n"
msgstr "她说她想帮忙。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/11
msgid ""
"It would only be temporary. She's still in\n"
"shock.\n"
msgstr "只是暂时的。她还没\n缓过来。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/12
msgid ""
"Right now, no one understands her better\n"
"than we do.\n"
msgstr "现在没人比我们更\n了解她。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/13
msgid ""
"OK. But Kaz,\n"
msgstr "确定。但卡兹，\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/14
msgid ""
"don't take your eyes off her.\n"
msgstr "别让她离开视线。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/16
msgid ""
"It won't be easy getting used to this kind\n"
"of life.\n"
msgstr "适应这种生活可\n不容易。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/17
msgid ""
"I know, Snake. I'm not trying to turn her\n"
"into one of us.\n"
msgstr "我知道，SNAKE。我不是想让她\n变成我们的人。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/18
msgid ""
"You should talk to her yourself later.\n"
msgstr "你回头自己跟她谈谈。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/20
msgid ""
"And, ah,\n"
msgstr "还有，呃，\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/21
msgid ""
"Dr. Strangelove wants to come, too.\n"
msgstr "斯特兰奇洛夫博士也想来。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/22
#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/3
msgid ""
"Strangelove?\n"
msgstr "斯特兰奇洛夫？\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/23
msgid ""
"Well she's out of a job now, and she'd\n"
"have a problem returning to England.\n"
msgstr "她现在没工作了，回\n英国也有麻烦。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/24
msgid ""
"You can talk to her about it.\n"
msgstr "你可以跟她谈。\n"

#: codec/2/915/0x393270/25
msgid ""
"Anyway, you don't need me to tell you\n"
"how good she'd be for R&D.\n"
msgstr "总之不用我说你也知道\n她对研发有多重要。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, we fitted ZEKE with its own AI Pod.\n"
msgstr "SNAKE，我们给吉克装了AI舱。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/1
msgid ""
"We were having trouble adjusting the AI,\n"
msgstr "AI调试一直不顺，\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/2
msgid ""
"but Dr. Strangelove was able to get it up\n"
"and running.\n"
msgstr "但斯特兰奇洛夫博士把它\n弄好能跑了。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/4
msgid ""
"Why the surprise, Snake?\n"
msgstr "惊讶什么，SNAKE？\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/5
msgid ""
"Well... We're an army without borders.\n"
msgstr "这个嘛……我们是没有国界的军队。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/6
msgid ""
"We need a deterrent against foreign\n"
"intervention - that's what ZEKE is for.\n"
msgstr "我们需要威慑外国\n干涉——吉克就是为此。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/7
msgid ""
"It may even prove necessary to...\n"
msgstr "甚至可能有必要……\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/8
msgid ""
"I'm not against deterrence itself.\n"
msgstr "我并不反对威慑本身。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/9
msgid ""
"The problem is when a nation comes to\n"
"rely on it.\n"
msgstr "问题在于，国家开始\n依赖它时。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/10
msgid ""
"All that does is force a burden on its\n"
"people...\n"
msgstr "这样做只会给其\n人民带来负担……\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/11
msgid ""
"the same people that constitute the\n"
"nation itself.\n"
msgstr "而这些人正是构成\n国家本身的人。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/12
msgid ""
"The existence of nations is detrimental to\n"
"man.\n"
msgstr "国家的存在对\n人类是有害的。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/13
msgid ""
"That's why I, one without a nation, see\n"
"potential in MSF.\n"
msgstr "这就是为什么我，一个没有国家的人，在MSF中看到了\n潜力。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/14
msgid ""
"But power is required for you to distance\n"
"yourself from nations.\n"
msgstr "但你需要力量才能让自己\n远离国家。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/15
msgid ""
"I will do whatever I can to assist with that.\n"
msgstr "我会尽力协助你。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/16
msgid ""
"...Glad to hear it.\n"
msgstr "……太好了。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/17
msgid ""
"And... I merely lent Huey a helping hand.\n"
msgstr "而且……我只是帮了休伊。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/18
msgid ""
"I will not give ZEKE an AI like hers.\n"
msgstr "我不会给吉克装那种AI。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x3945b0/19
msgid ""
"I wouldn't expect you to.\n"
msgstr "我也没指望你会。\n"

#: codec/2/916/0x394bd0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, I'm proud to announce that\n"
"preparations for Metal Gear ZEKE are\n"
"complete.\n"
msgstr "SNAKE，我荣幸宣布，\n合金装备·吉克准备\n完成。\n"

#. speaker 0x0ea8e31c voice v_myo_rad_0080_000_0
#. timeline 1462..2048
#: codec/2/916/0x394bd0/1
msgid ""
"We can activate it any time.\n"
msgstr "随时可以启动。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0080_000_0
#. timeline 2048..2702
#: codec/2/916/0x394bd0/2
msgid ""
"Got it. Thanks, Huey.\n"
msgstr "明白。谢了，休伊。\n"

#. speaker 0x0ea8e31c voice v_myo_rad_0080_000_0
#. timeline 2758..3176
#: codec/2/916/0x394bd0/3
msgid ""
"No need to thank me.\n"
msgstr "不用谢我。\n"

#. speaker 0x0ea8e31c voice v_myo_rad_0080_000_0
#. timeline 3218..4068
#: codec/2/916/0x394bd0/4
msgid ""
"At least now I can finally say I helped you\n"
"with something.\n"
msgstr "至少现在我能说，\n我帮上你忙了。\n"

#. speaker 0x0ea8e31c voice v_myo_rad_0080_000_0
#. timeline 4151..4806
#: codec/2/916/0x394bd0/5
msgid ""
"You can use it in Outer Ops, too.\n"
msgstr "外层作战也能用。\n"

#. speaker 0x0ea8e31c voice v_myo_rad_0080_000_0
#. timeline 4876..5712
#: codec/2/916/0x394bd0/6
msgid ""
"Just select ZEKE when you're forming\n"
"your unit.\n"
msgstr "在组建部队时\n选择ZEKE即可。\n"

#. speaker 0x0ea8e31c voice v_myo_rad_0080_000_0
#. timeline 5795..6492
#: codec/2/916/0x394bd0/7
msgid ""
"Be sure to take it out for a field test.\n"
msgstr "一定要带它去做实地测试。\n"

#. speaker 0x0ea8e31c voice v_myo_rad_0080_000_0
#. timeline 6798..7815
#: codec/2/916/0x394bd0/9
msgid ""
"You can change weapons and check\n"
"memory boards just like before.\n"
msgstr "可以像以前一样更换武器、\n查看记忆板。\n"

#. speaker 0x0ea8e31c voice v_myo_rad_0080_000_0
#. timeline 7927..9013
#: codec/2/916/0x394bd0/10
msgid ""
"Use your observations from a field test\n"
"to make any adjustments.\n"
msgstr "根据实地测试的观察结果\n进行调整。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0080_000_0
#. timeline 9027..9571
#: codec/2/916/0x394bd0/11
msgid ""
"A work in progress, huh?\n"
msgstr "还在完善？\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x3958b0/0
msgid ""
"Who would have thought that little girl\n"
"was working against us...\n"
msgstr "谁能想到那个小女孩\n竟在跟我们作对……\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x3958b0/1
msgid ""
"Tell me about it. She had everybody\n"
"fooled. Me included.\n"
msgstr "可不是嘛。她把所有人都\n骗了。包括我。\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x3958b0/2
msgid ""
"I can't believe I didn't pick up on anything.\n"
msgstr "真不敢相信我一点都没察觉。\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x3958b0/3
msgid ""
"Snake, there's no point beating yourself\n"
"up over the past.\n"
msgstr "SNAKE，过去的事\n自责也没用。\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x3958b0/4
msgid ""
"But hey,\n"
msgstr "不过话说回来，\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x3958b0/5
msgid ""
"maybe you should put in some practice\n"
"against ZEKE in case this sort of thing\n"
"ever happens again?\n"
msgstr "也许你该拿吉克\n练练手，以防\n再出这种事？\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x3958b0/6
msgid ""
"In any case, I need to go talk to Dr.\n"
"Strangelove.\n"
msgstr "总之，我得去跟\n斯特兰奇洛夫博士谈谈。\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x3958b0/7
msgid ""
"ZEKE still isn't ready.\n"
msgstr "吉克还没好。\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x3958b0/8
msgid ""
"Huey!\n"
msgstr "休伊！\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x395bd0/0
msgid ""
"Listen, Boss,\n"
msgstr "听我说，BOSS，\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0120_000_0
#. timeline 292..1086
#: codec/2/917/0x395bd0/1
msgid ""
"we both know you're the reason MSF's\n"
"grown so much.\n"
msgstr "你我都清楚，MSF能有今天\n全靠你。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0120_000_0
#. timeline 1100..1964
#: codec/2/917/0x395bd0/2
msgid ""
"But it's time we started putting more\n"
"thought into provisions.\n"
msgstr "但我们也该多考虑\n后勤补给了。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0120_000_0
#. timeline 1964..3106
#: codec/2/917/0x395bd0/3
msgid ""
"Good point. A place this big needs a good\n"
"stockpile on hand.\n"
msgstr "有道理。这么大的地方\n得有充足的储备。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0120_000_0
#. timeline 3120..4082
#: codec/2/917/0x395bd0/4
msgid ""
"The Japanese say, \"You can't fight on an\n"
"empty stomach.\"\n"
msgstr "日本的谚语说，\n“饿着肚子打不了仗。”\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0120_000_0
#. timeline 4109..4736
#: codec/2/917/0x395bd0/5
msgid ""
"Something we learned in World War II.\n"
msgstr "这是二战给我们的教训。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0120_000_0
#. timeline 5196..6561
#: codec/2/917/0x395bd0/7
msgid ""
"Maintaining a steady supply of provisions\n"
"is one of the basic principles of logistics.\n"
msgstr "保持稳定的补给\n是后勤的基本原则之一。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0120_000_0
#. timeline 6575..7300
#: codec/2/917/0x395bd0/8
msgid ""
"So I went ahead and set up a Mess Hall\n"
"Team.\n"
msgstr "所以我组建了\n食堂班。\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x395bd0/9
msgid ""
"The team members' numbers and abilities\n"
"will affect the amount of grub to go\n"
"around.\n"
msgstr "队员的人数和能力\n会影响\n食物的供应量。\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x395bd0/10
msgid ""
"Without enough food, morale will drop.\n"
msgstr "食物不够，士气就会下降。\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x395bd0/11
msgid ""
"They get hungry enough, and we could\n"
"start losing people.\n"
msgstr "饿急了，\n我们可能会开始流失人手。\n"

#: codec/2/917/0x395bd0/12
msgid ""
"Anyway, I need you to assign guys to the\n"
"Mess Hall Team.\n"
msgstr "总之，需要你派人\n去食堂班。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396100/0
msgid ""
"Boss, one more thing...\n"
msgstr "BOSS，还有事……\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396100/1
msgid ""
"Now what?\n"
msgstr "又怎么了？\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396100/2
msgid ""
"It's about sick bay.\n"
msgstr "关于医务室。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396100/3
msgid ""
"Naturally, we can use it for the sick or\n"
"injured, like we did with Amanda.\n"
msgstr "当然，可以收治伤病员，\n就像阿曼达那样。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396100/4
msgid ""
"But we can't expect people to get better\n"
"without the proper treatment.\n"
msgstr "但没有适当的治疗，\n人是不可能康复的。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396100/5
msgid ""
"...Uh huh.\n"
msgstr "嗯嗯。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396100/6
msgid ""
"So I figure we'll need a Medical Team for\n"
"that.\n"
msgstr "所以我想得有个医疗团队来\n处理。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396100/7
msgid ""
"The number of team members, and their\n"
"abilities will determine how quickly the\n"
"sick and injured heal.\n"
msgstr "队员的数量以及他们的\n能力将决定伤病员\n恢复的速度。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396100/8
msgid ""
"They can also monitor everybody's health.\n"
msgstr "他们还能监控大家健康。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396100/9
msgid ""
"Right. Prevention is the best medicine.\n"
msgstr "对。预防胜于治疗。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396100/11
msgid ""
"Remember to wash your hands often and\n"
"gargle twice a day, Boss.\n"
msgstr "老大，记得要勤洗手，\n每天漱口两次。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396100/12
msgid ""
"If only I had the time.\n"
msgstr "哪有那时间。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396580/0
msgid ""
"Boss! I had an idea. Listen to this.\n"
msgstr "BOSS！我有主意。听我说。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0160_000_0
#. timeline 794..1156
#: codec/2/918/0x396580/1
msgid ""
"Lemme guess.\n"
msgstr "让我猜猜。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0160_000_0
#. timeline 1198..2201
#: codec/2/918/0x396580/2
msgid ""
"You want to start running ads in the local\n"
"gossip rags.\n"
msgstr "你想在当地的\n八卦小报上投放广告。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0160_000_0
#. timeline 2243..2883
#: codec/2/918/0x396580/3
msgid ""
"Please, what do you take me for?\n"
msgstr "拜托，你把我当什么？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0160_000_0
#. timeline 2967..4137
#: codec/2/918/0x396580/4
msgid ""
"I thought that with all the new guys we've\n"
"got, we should get an Intel Team going.\n"
msgstr "我想着既然我们有了这么多\n新人，应该组建一个情报团队。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0160_000_0
#. timeline 4179..5210
#: codec/2/918/0x396580/5
msgid ""
"We'd send agents around the country to\n"
"scout out different locations.\n"
msgstr "我们会派特工到全国各地\n侦察不同的地点。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0160_000_0
#. timeline 5280..6227
#: codec/2/918/0x396580/6
msgid ""
"That way we're better prepared - no\n"
"matter where we end up.\n"
msgstr "这样准备更充分，无论\n最终落脚在哪。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0160_000_0
#. timeline 6436..7230
#: codec/2/918/0x396580/7
msgid ""
"That's actually not a bad idea.\n"
msgstr "这主意倒是不错。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0160_000_0
#. timeline 7230..8178
#: codec/2/918/0x396580/8
msgid ""
"They could probably develop recon\n"
"equipment for us, too.\n"
msgstr "他们或许还能为我们\n开发侦察设备。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0160_000_0
#. timeline 8192..9376
#: codec/2/918/0x396580/9
msgid ""
"We could also have them transport goods\n"
"and direct the Mother Base support\n"
"strikes.\n"
msgstr "我们还可以让他们运输货物\n并指挥母基地的支援\n打击。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0160_000_0
#. timeline 9501..10644
#: codec/2/918/0x396580/10
msgid ""
"You can send an item to a Co-Op\n"
"teammate from the \"DELIVERY\" Menu.\n"
msgstr "你可以从“DELIVERY”菜单向\n合作队友发送物品。\n"

#: codec/2/918/0x396990/0
msgid ""
"Hey, Boss, you mind if we powwow for a\n"
"sec?\n"
msgstr "嘿，老大，你介意我们\n聊一会儿吗？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 891..1755
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/1
msgid ""
"What now? MSF-brand rations?\n"
msgstr "又怎么了？MSF口粮？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 1769..2424
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/2
msgid ""
"Actually, that sounds - No, no!\n"
msgstr "其实听起来——不不！\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 2438..3845
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/3
msgid ""
"With all the men we have now, it may be\n"
"time we started sending some of them to\n"
"other countries.\n"
msgstr "以我们现在的人手，也许是时候\n开始派一些人去\n其他国家了。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 3859..4555
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/4
msgid ""
"You mean dispatching mercs?\n"
msgstr "你是说派雇佣兵？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 4583..5294
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/5
msgid ""
"How else are we gonna keep feeding the\n"
"crew we have?\n"
msgstr "不然我们怎么养活\n现有的这帮弟兄？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 5322..5851
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/6
msgid ""
"I know... You're right.\n"
msgstr "我知道……你说得对。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 5879..7230
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/7
msgid ""
"Okay. To deploy troops, select \"Outer\n"
"Ops\" from the Mother Base Menu.\n"
msgstr "好的。部署部队请从母基地菜单\n选“外勤任务”。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 7230..7606
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/8
msgid ""
"If it goes really well,\n"
msgstr "如果一切顺利，\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 7634..8930
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/9
msgid ""
"we might even get new recruits, weapon\n"
"design specs, or leads on new missions.\n"
msgstr "甚至可能招到新人、拿到武器开发规格，\n或新任务线索。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 8944..10212
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/10
msgid ""
"We can deploy any vehicles or large-scale\n"
"weapons in our arsenal as well.\n"
msgstr "我们也可以部署军械库中的任何车辆或\n大型武器。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 10226..10950
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/11
msgid ""
"And if things don't go \"really well\"...?\n"
msgstr "要是不太顺利呢……？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 10950..11563
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/12
msgid ""
"Yeah. We could lose men.\n"
msgstr "是啊。可能会损失人手。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0170_000_0
#. timeline 11591..12650
#: codec/2/918/0x396990/13
msgid ""
"I won't try and force you. You're the one\n"
"calling the shots here, Boss.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/919/0x3971e0/0
msgid ""
"Package for you, Boss.\n"
msgstr "有你的包裹，BOSS。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0190_000_0
#. timeline 599..1226
#: codec/2/919/0x3971e0/2
msgid ""
"Yeah. Looks like a cassette tape.\n"
msgstr "嗯。看起来是盒磁带。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0190_000_0
#. timeline 1267..2215
#: codec/2/919/0x3971e0/3
msgid ""
"Don't worry, it's clean. No trace of\n"
"explosives or anything.\n"
msgstr "别担心，很干净。没有爆炸物或\n任何痕迹。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0190_000_0
#. timeline 2243..2967
#: codec/2/919/0x3971e0/4
msgid ""
"Return address just says \"EVA.\"\n"
msgstr "寄件人只写了“EVA”。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0190_000_0
#. timeline 2995..3232
#: codec/2/919/0x3971e0/5
msgid ""
"EVA...\n"
msgstr "EVA……\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0190_000_0
#. timeline 3260..3524
#: codec/2/919/0x3971e0/6
msgid ""
"Someone you know?\n"
msgstr "你认识？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0190_000_0
#. timeline 3831..4444
#: codec/2/919/0x3971e0/7
msgid ""
"Old... acquaintance.\n"
msgstr "老……相识。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0190_000_0
#. timeline 4527..5670
#: codec/2/919/0x3971e0/8
msgid ""
"Ho ho hooo, the plot thickens. Tidings\n"
"from an old flame?\n"
msgstr "呵呵呵，越来越有意思了。旧情人\n来信？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_myo_rad_0190_000_0
#. timeline 5670..6979
#: codec/2/919/0x3971e0/9
msgid ""
"Don't start, Kaz. Anyway, I'll check it out\n"
"later.\n"
msgstr "别说了，Kaz。总之我稍后\n去看。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0190_000_0
#. timeline 6979..7857
#: codec/2/919/0x3971e0/10
msgid ""
"OK, just don't go running off after this\n"
"chick.\n"
msgstr "好吧，只是别之后跑去追那\n女人。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_myo_rad_0190_000_0
#. timeline 7913..8791
#: codec/2/919/0x3971e0/11
msgid ""
"We can't afford for you to be \"distracted\"\n"
"right now.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/919/0x397550/0
msgid ""
"Got anything you can use to blow up that\n"
"barricade?\n"
msgstr "你有啥能炸掉那个\n路障的？\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397550/1
msgid ""
"Don't think so...\n"
msgstr "应该没有…\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397550/2
msgid ""
"It depends on what kind of barricade it is,\n"
"but...\n"
msgstr "得看那是什么样的路障，\n不过……\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397550/3
msgid ""
"I'm gonna need some powerful explosives.\n"
msgstr "我需要强力炸药。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397550/4
msgid ""
"Think you could work something up at\n"
"Mother Base?\n"
msgstr "你觉得能在母基地\n做出点什么吗？\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397550/5
msgid ""
"How about asking the R&D team to make you\n"
"C4 explosives?\n"
msgstr "让研发团队给你做C4炸药\n怎么样？\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397550/6
msgid ""
"If we don't have enough manpower, you'll\n"
"have to go find some somewhere...\n"
msgstr "如果我们人手不够，你就\n得去别处找一些……\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397550/7
msgid ""
"But first, see what we've got going on at\n"
"Mother Base, Snake.\n"
msgstr "不过先看看母基地\n有啥进展吧，Snake。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397840/0
msgid ""
"Snake, the C4 we're working on right now\n"
"will help you blow a hole in that barricade.\n"
msgstr "Snake，我们现在正在研发的C4\n能帮你在那道路障上炸开一个洞。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397840/1
msgid ""
"Give us a little more time to finish it.\n"
msgstr "再给我们点时间完成它。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397840/2
msgid ""
"Alright.\n"
msgstr "好。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397840/3
msgid ""
"Just be aware that if we run out of GMP,\n"
msgstr "只是要记住，GMP一旦用完，\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397840/4
msgid ""
"work's going to grind to a halt, and we'll\n"
"have to add some folks to the Combat\n"
"Unit.\n"
msgstr "工作会陷入停滞，我们就\n得往战斗\n部队里添些人手了。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397840/5
msgid ""
"I'll keep it in mind.\n"
msgstr "我会记住的。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397a80/0
msgid ""
"Snake, I've got just the explosive to bust\n"
"through that barricade - C4.\n"
msgstr "Snake，我正好有能炸穿\n那道路障的炸药——C4。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397a80/1
msgid ""
"We've finished developing C4 charges.\n"
"Take some with you.\n"
msgstr "C4炸药已研发完成。\n带上一些吧。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397ba0/0
msgid ""
"Snake! Weapons and items development\n"
"is going nowhere fast.\n"
msgstr "Snake！武器和物品的研发\n毫无进展。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397ba0/1
msgid ""
"Send us some more soldiers with the\n"
"Fulton.\n"
msgstr "用富尔顿给我们送\n更多兵来。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397cb0/0
msgid ""
"Snake... If we don't step up weapons and\n"
"items development here,\n"
msgstr "Snake……如果不在这推进武器和\n物品研发，\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397cb0/1
msgid ""
"I think you're gonna have more and more\n"
"problems completing missions down the\n"
"road.\n"
msgstr "我觉得你今后完成任务\n会面临越来越多\n的麻烦。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397df0/0
msgid ""
"Snake, we need more guys for weapons\n"
"and items development.\n"
msgstr "Snake，需要更多人手搞武器\n和物品研发。\n"

#: codec/2/919/0x397df0/1
msgid ""
"Get us some new recruits with the Fulton.\n"
msgstr "用富尔顿招些新兵来。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398120/0
msgid ""
"Someone's planning to extract enemy\n"
"soldiers via Fulton recovery.\n"
msgstr "有人正打算用富尔顿回收系统\n撤走敌方士兵。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398120/1
msgid ""
"Thwart their attempt by shooting down\n"
"the balloons. We're calling this the\n"
"\"Pooyan Mission.\"\n"
msgstr "击落那些气球，挫败他们的企图。\n我们把这叫做\n“Pooyan任务”。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398120/2
msgid ""
"Support our troops. Shoot those balloons!\n"
msgstr "支援我方。打爆那些气球！\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x3982b0/0
msgid ""
"Clear the rubble in the Cloud Forest\n"
"that's blocking our advance.\n"
msgstr "清除云林中阻挡我们前进的\n碎石。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x3982b0/1
msgid ""
"Some C4 could make short work of it.\n"
msgstr "用C4很快就能搞定。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x3982b0/2
msgid ""
"If you succeed, our efforts in this area\n"
"will be made that much easier.\n"
msgstr "你成功的话，我们在这片区域\n的行动会轻松得多。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398420/0
msgid ""
"Bad news: the Boss has fallen into enemy\n"
"hands. I'm sure he'll find a way to escape.\n"
msgstr "坏消息：Boss落入了敌人\n手中。我相信他会想办法逃脱的。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398420/1
msgid ""
"Actually, I'm more worried about his gear.\n"
"He's gonna have a tough time without it.\n"
msgstr "其实，我更担心他的装备。\n没有装备他会很难办。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398420/2
msgid ""
"That's where you come in.\n"
msgstr "这就要靠你了。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398420/3
msgid ""
"I need you to sneak in through the\n"
"mine's underground passage and recover\n"
msgstr "我需要你潜入\n矿井的地下通道，取回\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398420/4
msgid ""
"all of the Boss's equipment.\n"
msgstr "BOSS的所有装备。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398420/5
msgid ""
"I know you'd like to rescue him yourself,\n"
"but have faith.\n"
msgstr "我知道你想亲自救他，\n但要相信他们。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398420/6
msgid ""
"This will be more than enough. I'll be\n"
"watching you. Good luck.\n"
msgstr "这些足够了。我会\n看着你的。祝你好运。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398700/0
#: codec/2/920/0x3988a0/0
msgid ""
"Enemy reinforcements have been\n"
"dispatched to the underground passage\n"
"at the U.S. Missile Base.\n"
msgstr "敌军增援已派往\n美国导弹基地的\n地下通道。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398700/1
msgid ""
"The problem is, Snake's already there.\n"
msgstr "问题是，SNAKE已经在那了。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398700/2
msgid ""
"You've gotta find a way to defend this\n"
"position. Do not let them break through.\n"
msgstr "你得想办法守住这里。\n别让他们突破。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x3988a0/1
msgid ""
"They must not be allowed to enter the\n"
"Control Tower while Snake is there.\n"
msgstr "SNAKE在的时候，绝不能\n让他们进入管制塔。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x3988a0/2
msgid ""
"Defend this position. Do whatever it takes\n"
"to prevent the enemy from breaking\n"
"through.\n"
msgstr "守住这里。不惜一切\n阻止敌人\n突破。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398a60/0
msgid ""
"How's Paz doing?\n"
msgstr "帕兹咋样？\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_fop_kaz_1580_000_0
#. timeline 390..1699
#: codec/2/920/0x398a60/1
msgid ""
"OK so far. Still shocked about being lied\n"
"to by Zadornov...\n"
msgstr "目前还好。还在为被\n扎多尔诺夫骗了而震惊……\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_fop_kaz_1580_000_0
#. timeline 1713..2661
#: codec/2/920/0x398a60/2
msgid ""
"But she's actually getting along great\n"
"with the crew here at Mother Base.\n"
msgstr "但她跟母基地的人\n相处得挺好。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_fop_kaz_1580_000_0
#. timeline 2661..2953
#: codec/2/920/0x398a60/3
msgid ""
"Really.\n"
msgstr "真的。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_fop_kaz_1580_000_0
#. timeline 3023..3343
#: codec/2/920/0x398a60/4
msgid ""
"That's good to hear.\n"
msgstr "那就好。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_fop_kaz_1580_000_0
#. timeline 3357..3524
#: codec/2/920/0x398a60/5
msgid ""
"Still,\n"
msgstr "不过，\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_fop_kaz_1580_000_0
#. timeline 3524..4917
#: codec/2/920/0x398a60/6
msgid ""
"it's got to be depressing for a girl her\n"
"age to be cooped up on an offshore plant\n"
"all day,\n"
msgstr "她这年纪的女孩，\n整天困在离岸工厂，\n肯定很压抑，\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_fop_kaz_1580_000_0
#. timeline 4987..5503
#: codec/2/920/0x398a60/7
msgid ""
"even if it is only temporary.\n"
msgstr "哪怕只是暂时的。\n"

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_fop_kaz_1580_000_0
#. timeline 5586..6464
#: codec/2/920/0x398a60/8
msgid ""
"I bet she'd love it if you took her out\n"
"somewhere once in a while.\n"
msgstr "你要是偶尔带她出去\n她肯定很开心。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398d50/0
msgid ""
"Snake...the sunsets are so pretty here...\n"
msgstr "SNAKE……这里的夕阳真美……\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398d50/1
msgid ""
"Are you feeling OK, Kaz?\n"
msgstr "没事吧，卡兹？\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398d50/2
msgid ""
"Yeah, I mean...I've got MSF business to\n"
"think about and all,\n"
msgstr "嗯，我是说……我得考虑\nMSF的事，\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398d50/3
msgid ""
"but sometimes it's nice to just sit and\n"
"watch the sunset, you know?\n"
msgstr "但有时坐下来看看夕阳\n也挺好的，对吧？\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398d50/4
msgid ""
"...Yyyyeah.\n"
msgstr "……是——啊。\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398d50/5
msgid ""
"Snake, um...would you be up for going to\n"
"the coast to watch the sunset?\n"
msgstr "SNAKE，呃……要不要去\n海边看夕阳？\n"

#: codec/2/920/0x398d50/6
msgid ""
"Just the two of us?\n"
msgstr "就我们俩？\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399140/0
msgid ""
"Time for your mission briefing.\n"
msgstr "该做任务简报了。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399140/1
msgid ""
"This is going to be a tough one. Be ready\n"
"for a protracted fight.\n"
msgstr "这会是一场硬仗。做好\n打持久战的准备。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399140/2
msgid ""
"I know you can do it. Get out there and\n"
"kick some ass!\n"
msgstr "你能行。上吧，\n狠狠打他们！\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x3992a0/0
msgid ""
"Here's a rundown of your mission.\n"
msgstr "这是你的任务简报。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x3992a0/1
msgid ""
"This one's perfect for a warm up. Nice\n"
"and easy.\n"
msgstr "这个正好用来热身。轻松\n又简单。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x3992a0/2
msgid ""
"Don't let yourself get lazy, though. Stick\n"
"to it and get the job done.\n"
msgstr "不过别让自己偷懒。坚持\n下去，把任务完成。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399400/0
msgid ""
"Commencing training mission.\n"
msgstr "开始训练任务。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399400/1
msgid ""
"Missions like this are key to building up\n"
"your basic skills.\n"
msgstr "像这样的任务是打好\n基本功的关键。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399400/2
msgid ""
"Be careful out there.\n"
msgstr "小心点。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399530/0
msgid ""
"Commencing mission.\n"
msgstr "开始任务。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399530/1
msgid ""
"You're in for some heavy combat with\n"
"this one.\n"
msgstr "这次你要面对一场\n激烈的战斗。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399530/2
msgid ""
"Try and make it back in one piece.\n"
msgstr "务必活着回来。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399660/0
msgid ""
"This is a high-risk mission.\n"
msgstr "这是高风险任务。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399660/1
msgid ""
"You'll be facing some powerful opposition.\n"
msgstr "你会面对强劲的敌人。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399660/2
msgid ""
"But it's nothing you can't handle. Believe\n"
"in yourself.\n"
msgstr "但这难不倒你。相信\n自己。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x3997a0/0
msgid ""
"We've got a... uh, special request for you\n"
"today.\n"
msgstr "今天有个……呃，\n特别任务给你。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x3997a0/1
msgid ""
"Yeah...umm...\n"
msgstr "对，嗯\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x3997a0/2
msgid ""
"Here, have a look.\n"
msgstr "来，看看。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x3998b0/0
msgid ""
"You're not gonna believe this...\n"
msgstr "你肯定不敢相信……\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x3998b0/1
msgid ""
"Suddenly we've got a Gear REX on board\n"
"Mother Base and it's raising hell up on\n"
"the deck.\n"
msgstr "突然有一台Gear REX出现在母基地\n上，正在甲板上\n大肆破坏。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x3998b0/2
msgid ""
"I don't know what we did to piss it\n"
"off...but this is the biggest crisis in MSF's\n"
"history.\n"
msgstr "我不知道我们怎么惹毛了\n它……但这是MSF\n史上最大的危机。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x3998b0/3
msgid ""
"We need you to hunt it down and save\n"
"our Outer Heaven!\n"
msgstr "需要你猎杀它，拯救\n我们的Outer Heaven！\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399aa0/0
msgid ""
"Last night, a Gear REX came ashore on\n"
"the southern Pacific coast of Costa Rica.\n"
msgstr "昨晚，一台Gear REX在\n哥斯达黎加南太平洋沿岸登陆。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399aa0/1
msgid ""
"From there it headed north and reached\n"
"the vicinity of Irazú's crater around noon\n"
"today.\n"
msgstr "它从那里向北行进，今天中午\n左右抵达了\n伊拉苏火山口附近。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399aa0/2
msgid ""
"As of now it's stopped moving.\n"
msgstr "目前它已停止移动。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399aa0/3
msgid ""
"Costa Rica doesn't have an army to deal\n"
"with threats this big.\n"
msgstr "哥斯达黎加没有军队来应对\n这么大的威胁。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399aa0/4
msgid ""
"We're getting dozens of reports of\n"
"damage to nearby houses and other\n"
"buildings.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x399aa0/5
msgid ""
"For the sake of peace in Costa Rica,\n"
msgstr "为了哥斯达黎加的和平，\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399aa0/6
msgid ""
"we need you to head to the crater and\n"
"get the Gear REX under control!\n"
msgstr "需要你前往弹坑，\n控制住霸王！\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399da0/0
msgid ""
"It'd be a good idea to do some combat\n"
"training with ZEKE.\n"
msgstr "和吉克做点战斗训练\n会很有帮助。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399da0/1
msgid ""
"It'll just be a mock battle, though.\n"
"Nothing'll happen to ZEKE for real.\n"
msgstr "不过只是模拟战。\n吉克不会真出事。\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399da0/2
msgid ""
"Attack ZEKE as if you were actually going\n"
"against him, OK?\n"
msgstr "就当是真打一样攻击吉克，\n确定？\n"

#: codec/2/921/0x399f20/0
msgid ""
"dummy\n"
msgstr "假人\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a120/0
msgid ""
"Target practice commences now. Shoot\n"
"all the targets in the Kill House!\n"
msgstr "打靶训练开始。射杀\n击杀屋里的所有目标！\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a120/1
#: codec/2/922/0x39a3b0/1
msgid ""
"When the timer reaches zero, the\n"
"exercise is over.\n"
msgstr "计时归零时，\n训练结束。\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a240/0
msgid ""
"Commence target practice.\n"
msgstr "开始打靶训练。\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a240/1
msgid ""
"As a special treat, you can practice freely\n"
"on any of the targets in the shooting\n"
"range today.\n"
msgstr "作为特别优待，今天可以在靶场\n自由练习射击\n任意目标。\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a240/2
msgid ""
"Shoot away! When you're done, head\n"
"over to the exit.\n"
msgstr "尽情射击！结束后前往\n出口。\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a3b0/0
msgid ""
"Target practice commencing now. Shoot\n"
"all the targets in the shooting range!\n"
msgstr "打靶训练开始。射杀\n靶场里的所有目标！\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a4d0/0
msgid ""
"Looks like our reputation is spreading.\n"
msgstr "看来我们的名声传开了。\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a4d0/1
msgid ""
"We've got battle-hardened veterans from\n"
"all kinds of places trying to join our army!\n"
msgstr "各地身经百战的老兵\n都想加入我们的部队！\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a4d0/2
msgid ""
"But, they insist on testing your skills to\n"
"see if you're the \"real deal\" before they'll\n"
"join.\n"
msgstr "但他们坚持要先测试你的本事，\n看你是不是\"真货\"，才肯\n加入。\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a4d0/3
msgid ""
"Lets put these arrogant upstarts in their\n"
"place!\n"
msgstr "让这些狂妄家伙\n认清位置！\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a4d0/4
msgid ""
"Take them down using hand-to-hand\n"
"strikes or CQC.\n"
msgstr "用格斗或CQC\n打倒他们。\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a4d0/5
msgid ""
"If you can knock 'em all out within the\n"
"time limit, they'll join us,\n"
msgstr "只要在时限内全部击倒，\n他们就会加入我们，\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a4d0/6
msgid ""
"becoming powerful allies.\n"
msgstr "成为强大的盟友。\n"

#: codec/2/922/0x39a4d0/7
msgid ""
"Don't disappoint 'em, Boss. Show 'em\n"
"what you got!\n"
msgstr "别让他们失望，BOSS。亮出\n本事来！\n"
